#: source/release-notes/index.md:1
msgid "Nix Release Notes"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/index.md:3
msgid "The Nix release cycle is calendar-based as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/index.md:5
msgid ""
"Nix has a release cycle of roughly 6 weeks. Notable changes and additions "
"are announced in the release notes for each version."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/index.md:8
msgid "The supported Nix versions are:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/index.md:9
msgid "The latest release"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/index.md:10
msgid ""
"The version used in the stable NixOS release, which is announced in the "
"[NixOS release notes](https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/stable/release-notes."
"html#ch-release-notes)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/index.md:12
msgid ""
"Bugfixes and security issues are backported to every supported version. "
"Patch releases are published as needed."
msgstr ""
